# Plan Structure Order

RULE: In .md files, ALL todos and completion gates MUST appear in the frontmatter YAML block (before the closing `---`). Notes, context, architecture, Mermaid diagrams go AFTER frontmatter.

WHY: The conflict-resolution-agent loads `head -250` per plan for non-relevant repos and full content for relevant repos. Todos buried after 250 lines of notes are invisible during automated conflict resolution.

DO: Put todos in frontmatter YAML → notes/context after `---` closing tag.

NEVER: Put architecture notes, Mermaid diagrams, or context sections inside the frontmatter block before the todos list.
